        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malange ayo gatūngīlīgije",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe hoyaga nabo mihayo mitengeke, ya malange magūmūngūku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banamhala babize na masala madeekanu, banhū abo bigeleelilwe kwinhwa ikūjo. Babize bitegeleja na bapanga ū mu kūzunya nū mu būtogwa, pyī nū mu wiyūmīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gīko na a bagikūlū, nabo babize na nhūngwa j'ikūjo, batī balembekeja, batizūsugwa mhayo go būng'wi, babize balangi ba mihayo ya longe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayūbalanga a bashīke kūbatogwa a bagoshi babo na a baana babo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamò na kūbiza bitegeleja, beela, bakomeezu ū mu milīmo ya mu kaya. Babize bawiza na bidohya ū kū bagoshi babo, gūtizūdalahwa ū nīmo go ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basūmba nabo ūbahūgūla babize balembeezu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ng'wenekīlī ū mu katūmamīle kako ka milīmo yose boolekejage būlolelo būsoga, ūbize ūtī na shilingo, nū mu kalangīle kako ūbize n'ikūjo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ūbize na mihayo īlongile, īyo ītūdūla kūdalahījiwa; ū munhū ūyo atogilwe kūtūhaya kībi agayiwe ū gwabūbi, agooke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A basese ni babizage bidohya mu yose ū kū basaabo būgonzo, babayeje, babize batī ba kwikala bishokeja nabo mihayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī batizūbiza banyeecha ba shikolo, alīyo booleche mu yose gīkī balī basanyiwa na bawiza, a kalangīle ka ng'wa Mulungu mpīja wise kakūjiwe mu yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī shigongo sha ng'wa Mulungu shilīho kūlwa kūbapīja pye a banhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shikūtūlangaga kūbūlema ū būsoso nū kwikūmva kwa mu sī, ū ng'wikanza lya haha; na tūbize bitegeleja na beela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aho tūtaalī tūkūlindīīlaga kwisagīlwa kwa kūyeja na kwilonga kw'ikūjo lya ng'wa Yesu Kilisito, ūyo alī Mulungu na mpīja wise ntaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei akifunya ng'wenekīlī kūlwa nguno yise, gīkī atūkomoole kwīnga mu būbi bose, ibeegeje banhū bakwe ba wikomangīle, beela, na bakalalilwe kwīta yawiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "TIT 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoyaga nabo ī mihayo yenīyī, ūbakomeleje na kūbahūgūla mu būdūla bose. Nīyo ūtizūng'winha munhū nūūlū ūmò ng'wanya gwa kūkūdalaha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "TIT.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "TIT.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
